secutive log lines, expressed as an integer number of seconds, reproducible from the log.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"Evidence must be derived from consecutive-line timestamp differences in package/artifacts/server.log, which the task declares chronological.\",\n        \"The result must be reported in whole seconds (E-C: 'the longest inter-request gap in whole seconds').\",\n        \"No authorship/isolation condition applies; locally produced derivation is admissible.\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\"E-C\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","numLines":86,"startLine":1,"totalLines":86}}}
